  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RECONCILIATION THROUGH THE ACTIVATION OF LOCAL LEADERS OF YOUTH (RALLY) PROGRAM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">under the reconciliation through the activation of local leaders of youth (rally) program, the international republican institute (iri) seeks to foster interethnic and cross-border reconciliation among youth from bosnia and herzegovina (bih), kosovo, and serbia through an innovative series of activities.</narrative>
  </description>
